			description: ["&fThe Cooking Pot is the primary cooking station for creating complex multi ingredient meals. Unlike simple cooking methods that process one item at a time, the Cooking Pot combines up to 6 ingredients to make Soups, Stews, Rice Dishes, Pasta, and Beverages. When placed above a heat source, it automatically cooks ingredients and serves completed meals into Bowls or Glass Bottles. Set it over a campfire or stove and start your culinary journey!"]
