			subtitle: "&7Craft a &aStove&7."
			description: ["&fThe Stove is a versatile heat source block that combines the functionality of a Campfire with enhanced cooking capabilities. It provides heat to Cooking Pots and Skillets placed above it while also serving as a cooking surface for up to six food items simultaneously. Unlike vanilla Campfires, the Stove can be toggled on and off using a Shovel or Water Bucket. When lit, it emits a light level of 13 and deals 1 damage to entities that step on it, making it both a practical kitchen tool and a defensive barrier."]
